# Without this the build context carries the host's dependency trees and build
# output into every image. On a workspace this is not merely slow: a Windows or
# macOS node_modules copied over the Linux one from `deps` produces binaries
# that cannot run, and a stale tsbuildinfo convinces `tsc -b` there is nothing
# to rebuild.
node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.next
**/.next
coverage
**/coverage
test-results
playwright-report

.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log

.turbo
tmp
dashboard/public/cesium

# Deployment material that no image needs baked in.
nginx/certs
nginx/acme
nginx/letsencrypt
